        <mxCell id="CL7ZZ1GVSzrmhWFDv7aY-1" value="&lt;b&gt;Process User Guess&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify the user still has guesses for the day&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Validate the guess is a valid word&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Insert valid guesses into the Guess Table against the user&#39;s UUID&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Return map matching letters/indices and win status&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;b&gt;Calculate Guess Suggestion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use the user&#39;s set of guess&#39;s with the known daily solution to calculate a &quot;good&quot; next guess&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Return X number words based on guessed letters and position&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Return the list of suggestions to the UI for rendering&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;b&gt;Get User Stats&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Select from the users guesses in the guess table&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use the users guesses to calculate win percentage, average attempts, frequent words, etc&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Return the statistics to the frontend for rendering&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Calculate &amp;amp; Save Today&#39;s Wordle Solution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;A scheduled event bridge event will trigger a function at midnight every day&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The function is Selenium bot integrated with the NYT Wordle website to derive the daily solution&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The solution is saved to the Wordle solution table&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5.5" y="421" width="570" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gakLt2WNvY610qKhPgTi-1" value="&lt;u&gt;Wordle Assistant - MVP Proposal&lt;/u&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=1;fontSize=20;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5.5" y="7" width="320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gakLt2WNvY610qKhPgTi-2" value="&lt;b&gt;MVP Overview&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The UI will look as close to the Wordle interface as possible&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Web UI will be hosted on AWS ECS Fargate&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;API gateway and Eventbridge will be the event sources&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Interactions trigger endpoints trigger lambda functions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Date will be persisted in a RDS database&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5.5" y="75" width="380" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
